msgid "Create the workflow for this manually in Paperless NGX:<ul><li><b>Trigger type</b>: \"Document Updated\"</li><li><b>Action type</b>: \"Webhook\"</li><li><b>Webhook URL</b> (example): <code>https://erp.example.com/api/method/svan_paperless_bridge.webhook_sync.receive_update</code></li><li><b>Use parameters for webhook body</b>: NOT set</li><li><b>Send webhook payload as JSON</b>: NOT set</li><li><b>Webhook body</b>: <code>{\"document_id\": {{ doc_id }}}</code></li><li><b>Webhook headers</b>: <code>Webhook-Secret</code> = the value from the \"Webhook Secret\" field below, and <code>Content-Type</code> = <code>application/json</code></li><li><b>Include document</b>: NOT set</li></ul>"
