#: svan_paperless_bridge/svan_paperless_ngx_bridge/doctype/svan_paperless_tag_mapping/svan_paperless_tag_mapping.json
msgid "When this mapping was last created or confirmed during a file upload."
msgstr "Zeitpunkt, zu dem diese Zuordnung zuletzt beim Datei-Upload angelegt oder bestaetigt wurde."

#. Description of the 'File Extension' (Data) field in DocType 'SVAN Paperless
#. File Type'
#: svan_paperless_bridge/svan_paperless_ngx_bridge/doctype/svan_paperless_file_type/svan_paperless_file_type.json
msgid "Without a leading dot, e.g. \"EXE\" (converted to upper case on save so it matches the extension Frappe determines internally)."
msgstr "Ohne Punkt, z. B. \"EXE\" (wird beim Speichern automatisch groß geschrieben, damit sie zur intern von Frappe ermittelten Endung passt)."

